        <activityName xml:lang="en">Portland slag sand cement, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Portland slag sand cement, at plant
Part of total Swiss cement production: 2%. Composition: gypsum 5%, blast furnace slag 19%, clinker 76%;
Synonyms: Zement, Portlandzement, cement, portland cement, CEM II A-S 42.5; 
UUID: 8cf80354-ba11-35a8-9c7d-3a87a6c8e2dd
includes the manufacturing processes mixing and grinding, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure (specific machines and plant). No administration and no packing is included. Special inputs: blast furnace slag, not balanced as it is waste from iron production
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 53766.06 t/a
Sampling: most data measured by all Swiss plants (8 plants) 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8cf80354-ba11-35a8-9c7d-3a87a6c8e2dd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
